# bench/* stays ignored EXCEPT the harness-critical, session-proven tooling
# (readiness primitive, canonical bench driver + quality leg, runbooks,
# LOOP-STATUS, 552-row results ledger, hot-path scale bench). Without these
# negations one `git clean` erases the whole dev harness (mined lesson H).
bench/*
!bench/gemma-research/
!bench/gemma-research/**
!bench/scale_bench.py
!bench/golden_rule.py
!bench/compare.py
!bench/RUNBOOK*.md
# junk that must stay ignored even inside the un-ignored dir
bench/gemma-research/__pycache__/
bench/gemma-research/*.1739
bench/gemma-research/*.corrupt*
results/*
